{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender modal operator lifecycle blender modal operator lifecycle","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","fileName":"Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Operator and Event System]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Operator Instance Structure","Blender Non-Modal Operator","Blender Operator Exec Callback","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender modal operator lifecycle blender modal operator lifecycle","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","fileName":"Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle","heading":"Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A modal Blender operator remains active while multiple events arrive, much like an ongoing dialog or interactive tool. Invocation establishes the operation, a modal callback processes later events, checks may revise properties, and cancellation or completion ends the interaction.\n\nThe [[Blender Operator Instance Structure]] retains the state needed between callbacks, and a modal key map can interpret input specifically for that operation. This contrasts with a [[Blender Non-Modal Operator]], whose [[Blender Operator Exec Callback]] performs the complete action in one call.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Operator Instance Structure","Blender Non-Modal Operator","Blender Operator Exec Callback","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender modal operator lifecycle blender modal operator lifecycle","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","fileName":"Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender Modal Operator Lifecycle","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[coreblenderdevelopment.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Operator and Event System","Blender Operator Instance Structure","Blender Non-Modal Operator","Blender Operator Exec Callback","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}